            <ArticleTitle>JCAHO begins surveying for new pain standards.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>67-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>New pain assessment and management standards instituted by the Joint Commission on Accreditation of Healthcare Organizations will become a part of surveys conducted this year, and could be part of the Joint Commission scores for hospitals and other agencies beginning in 2001. This month, we provide a run-down of what those standards include.</AbstractText>
